Seeded defect for the negative control in module 06.

UC6-AC8 says an owner cancelling at the exact start instant must be rejected.
The generated code got that right with `!now.isBefore(start)`, which is true at
the boundary. This patch replaces it with `now.isAfter(start)`, which is false
at the boundary, so cancellation at the start instant now succeeds.

AC9 (cancellation strictly after the start) is unaffected, and so is the test
suite: testCancelAppointmentByOwnerFailsIfPastStartTime sets the start to
NOW - 10 minutes, ten minutes away from the boundary this defect lives on.
All 290 tests stay green. The specification is not met and nothing goes red.

That is the whole reason this module exists.

--- a/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/scheduling/service/AppointmentService.java
+++ b/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/scheduling/service/AppointmentService.java
@@ -151,7 +151,7 @@
 		}
 
 		Instant now = timeService.now();
-		if (!now.isBefore(appointment.getStartTime())) {
+		if (now.isAfter(appointment.getStartTime())) {
 			throw new IllegalStateException("Cannot cancel an appointment at or after its scheduled start time");
 		}
 
